# {{projectName}}

Scaffolded with [`dude`](https://github.com/cubocicloide/dude) using the
`react-fastapi` stack.

## Quick start

> **Prerequisites** — Docker Desktop running and `dude` installed (`npm install -g @cubocicloide/dude`).

```bash
# 1. First run — build images and start all services
dude up --build

# 2. From the second run onward
dude up
```

That's it. Once the containers are up, open the URLs below.

### Services

| Service | URL | Notes |
|---------|-----|-------|
| **Frontend** | http://localhost:5173 | React + Vite — HMR active |
| **API** | http://localhost:8000 | FastAPI |
| **Swagger UI** | http://localhost:8000/docs | Interactive API explorer |
| **ReDoc** | http://localhost:8000/redoc | API reference docs |
| **Health** | http://localhost:8000/api/health | JSON health check |
{{#if withCelery}}
| **Flower** | http://localhost:5555 | Celery task monitor |
{{/if}}

### Hot reload

- **Frontend** — Vite HMR is on by default. Edit any file under `frontend/src/`
  and the browser updates instantly without a full page reload.
- **Backend** — Uvicorn runs with `--reload`. Edit any Python file under
  `backend/app/` and the API restarts automatically within a second.

### Common commands

| Command | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| `dude up --build` | Rebuild images and start all services |
| `dude up` | Start all services (detached) |
| `dude down` | Stop and remove containers |
| `dude logs [service]` | Follow logs (omit service to follow all) |
| `dude shell <service>` | Open a shell inside a running container |
| `dude api sync` | Fetch OpenAPI spec → regenerate typed client |
| `dude api review` | Validate generated client against the spec |
| `dude lint` | Run all stack lint checks |
| `dude docs` | Start documentation dev server (http://localhost:8001) |

## Project layout

```
{{projectName}}/
├── frontend/        # React + Vite + TypeScript
├── backend/         # FastAPI (Python 3.13)
│   └── app/
│       ├── core/       # settings, database session, shared utilities
│       ├── models/     # SQLAlchemy ORM models
│       ├── queries/    # database query functions
│       ├── routers/    # APIRouter modules (one file per resource)
│       ├── schemas/    # Pydantic request/response schemas
│       ├── tasks/      # Celery task definitions
│       ├── tests/      # pytest test suite
│       └── utils/      # pure helper functions
├── docs/            # MkDocs documentation site
└── docker-compose.yml
```

## Quick start — local (no Docker)

```bash
# Frontend (terminal 1)
cd frontend
pnpm install
pnpm dev          # http://localhost:5173

# Backend (terminal 2)
cd backend
uv sync
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload   # http://localhost:8000
```
